```

### Source Code (repository root)

```text
apps/web/src/
├── app/(app)/workspace/[datasetId]/
│   ├── page.tsx                 # Authorized workspace data boundary
│   └── actions.ts               # Existing annotation mutations; extend safely
├── app/(auth)/
│   ├── login/page.tsx            # Public returning-user entry page
